   "widgets_values": [
    "DEV TOOLS — no models required. Queue this workflow to verify the nodes.\n\nLayout Editor -> Layout Regions produces the selected box mask. Native composition changes only its red channel by 128/255.\n\nExpected (float32 tolerance): region 12,288 pixels (18.75%); inside MAE about 42.6667/255, outside MAE 0; global MAE 8/255 and changed 18.75%.\n\nMove the box or change padding and rerun: measurements follow the actual union. No automatic resizing or alignment.\n\nFor real experiments replace the two Image Audit inputs with matched-size reference/candidate images. Put the reference in the Layout Editor background and match its canvas. Select boxes by 1-based draft order.\n\nWhite = inside, not semantic segmentation. Differences do not establish edit success or quality. Per-pair metrics are in metrics_json; report can feed Suite Telemetry. Preview images are temporary."
   ],
